@startuml

top to bottom direction

Actor "<<External>>\n<center>User" as User1
Actor "<<External>>\n<center>Receiver" as User2

'Define process for Messenger system
rectangle "<center><<Process>>\nP1. Account Authentication\n[Sign up, log in, reset password]" as p1
rectangle "<center><<Process>>\nP3. Send message\n[send message]" as p3
rectangle "<center><<Process>>\nP2. Check Receiver's Status\n[store unread or send]" as p2
rectangle "<center><<Process>>\nP4. Group message\n[Form group, rename]" as p4

'Define database for Messenger system
  database "<center><<Store>>\nD1. Accounts Storage\n[Users's information]" as D1
  database "<center><<Store>>\n D2. Groups Storage\n [Group names, members]" as D2
  database "<center><<Store>>\n  D3. Messages Storage\n[Message, timestamp, status]" as D3

'Define the data flow for Messenger system
User1 --> p1: Account verification (FR01-FR06)
p1 -left-> D1: User's record (FR-06)

p1 --> p2: User send message (FR-07)
p2 --> p3: check receiver's status

p3 --> User2: send message to receiver
p3 -> D3: Store message history(FR-08, FR-12)
p2 -> D3: Store unread message (FR-13)

User1 --> p4: Form a group 
p4 -> D2: Group's record (FR-10,FR-11)
p4 --> p2: send message to a group

@enduml